# Code owners: a change under these paths needs the owner's review before it
# merges, where the repository's branch rules require review from code
# owners. The publication guard's checker and the workflows that run it are
# what a pull request would have to edit to read the guard's secrets, so a
# second pair of eyes is the control. An author cannot approve their own pull
# request, so an owner-authored change here needs another maintainer's
# review.
/.github/                 @merocle
/tools/publication-guard/ @merocle
